{"id":"07c01766ddf08181","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic.md","title":"Rice Theorem (Arithmetic Version)","display":"thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic — Rice Theorem (Arithmetic Version)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic","aliases":["92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic"],"display":"thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic — Rice Theorem (Arithmetic Version)","depends_on":["[[92-df-ce-set]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]","[[92-df-halting-set]]","[[92-thm-halting-undecidable]]"],"source":"本地计算模型扩展；给定 PDF 未见 Rice 定理正文","source_status":"原书之外的递归论补充"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic — Rice Theorem (Arithmetic Version)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8665bbc504ca9fb6\" href=\"?note=8665bbc504ca9fb6\" title=\"92-thm-halting-undecidable\">92-thm-halting-undecidable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地计算模型扩展；给定 PDF 未见 Rice 定理正文"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书之外的递归论补充"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> is the fixed acceptable enumeration from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a>, including effective parameterization; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\">\\(W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> (extensional property of CE sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(I_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (index set for the property)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid W_e\\in\\mathcal P\\},\n\\qquad\n\\Bigl(\\exists e\\;W_e\\in\\mathcal P\\Bigr)\n\\land\\Bigl(\\exists e\\;W_e\\notin\\mathcal P\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(I_{\\mathcal P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid W_e\\in\\mathcal P\\},\n\\qquad\n\\Bigl(\\exists e\\;W_e\\in\\mathcal P\\Bigr)\n\\land\\Bigl(\\exists e\\;W_e\\notin\\mathcal P\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(I_{\\mathcal P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rice定理判定的是程序/枚举器的索引集合，而不是把性质对象本身写成<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner P\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner P\\urcorner\\)</span></li>\n<li>非平凡：存在r.e.集满足性质，也存在r.e.集不满足</li>\n<li>例如“枚举集是否非空”“是否有限”等非平凡外延性质的索引集不可判定</li>\n<li>例：&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>是否有限&quot;不可判定</li>\n<li>Rice定理是停机问题的推广</li>\n<li>Rice定理与可证性不可判定可通过计算归约联系，但“句子是否可证”不是这里对单个c.e.集合的外延性质，因此不完备性不是本定理的字面特例</li>\n</ul>\n<p>证明：按非平凡性选一个 c.e. 集 B，使 B 与空集关于该性质的真假不同。对参数 e 构造程序：先模拟 φ_e(e)，仅当该模拟停机后才开始半判定 B；若模拟始终不停机，则程序对每个输入都不停机。可接受编号的参数化性质给出总递归索引函数 h，其 W_h(e) 在 e∉K 时为空集，在 e∈K 时为 B。</p>\n<p>若 I_𝒫 有判定器，输入 h(e) 并将性质真假与空集的固定真假比较，就能判定 e∈K，与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8665bbc504ca9fb6\" href=\"?note=8665bbc504ca9fb6\" title=\"92-thm-halting-undecidable\">92-thm-halting-undecidable</a> 矛盾。外延性确保性质只取决于 W_h(e)，而不是程序文本或运行速度。该证明没有声称能算法选出 B；固定任一非平凡性的见证即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>保留为扩展材料。原书第 IV 章的 Σ₁/recursive 与第 VII 章的强分离是相关背景，但不是 Rice 定理的原文证明；此条已给出自身的可接受编号归约论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-halting-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-halting-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"8665bbc504ca9fb6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-halting-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ is the fixed acceptable enumeration from [[92-df-halting-set]], including effective parameterization; $W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)$","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-halting-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"8665bbc504ca9fb6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"若 I_𝒫 有判定器，输入 h(e) 并将性质真假与空集的固定真假比较，就能判定 e∈K，与 [[92-thm-halting-undecidable]] 矛盾。外延性确保性质只取决于 W_h(e)，而不是程序文本或运行速度。该证明没有声称能算法选出 B；固定任一非平凡性的见证即可。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid W_e\\in\\mathcal P\\},\n\\qquad\n\\Bigl(\\exists e\\;W_e\\in\\mathcal P\\Bigr)\n\\land\\Bigl(\\exists e\\;W_e\\notin\\mathcal P\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(I_{\\mathcal P})","display":true},{"tex":"\\ulcorner P\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":2704,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-299","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic]]"}],"outgoing":["69a2a133da01f9c9","b090f61b9f3ec664","06a154edf19ea063","8665bbc504ca9fb6"]}